---
title: Normal Chat — Reporter Tells, Bot Answers
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: "Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"
    fontSize: 14px
---

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor reporter as Reporter
    participant line as LINE
    participant webhook as App: webhook<br/>controllers/line.py
    participant worker as App: worker<br/>workers/worker.py
    participant redis as Redis
    participant postgres as PostgreSQL
    participant gemini as Gemini

    %% reporter accepted PDPA before · first time: sequence-pdpa.mmd
    %% a limit is hit: sequence-hit-limit.mmd · Gemini fails: sequence-fallback.mmd

    %% 1. Message comes in
    rect rgba(120, 160, 255, 0.12)
        reporter ->> line: text, photo, location pin or sticker
        line ->> webhook: POST /webhook/line with X-Line-Signature
        Note over webhook: wrong signature: 400, nothing saved
        webhook ->> postgres: find user by LINE id
        Note over webhook: video, audio, file: ignored
        webhook ->> postgres: open a session or use the open one<br/>last_message_at = now
        webhook ->> postgres: save message, role user, status pending<br/>pin as lat/lng, sticker as LINE keywords
        Note over webhook: limits checked here: sequence-hit-limit.mmd
        webhook ->> redis: add message to buffer, last_message_at = now
        webhook ->> redis: IDLE to BUFFERING
        opt state changed in this call
            webhook ->> redis: push chat job
        end
        webhook -->> line: 200 OK, no reply here
    end

    %% 2. Worker waits until the reporter stops typing
    rect rgba(120, 220, 160, 0.12)
        worker ->> redis: pop chat job
        loop until SILENCE_SECONDS 3 pass with no new message
            worker ->> redis: read last_message_at
            Note over webhook,redis: more messages join the buffer, no new job
        end
        worker ->> redis: BUFFERING to PROCESSING
        worker ->> redis: read buffer
    end

    %% 3. Gemini answers
    rect rgba(255, 190, 110, 0.12)
        worker ->> postgres: LINE id of the session owner
        worker ->> line: show loading for up to 60 seconds
        line ->> reporter: typing dots
        opt buffer has photos
            worker ->> line: download photo
            worker ->> postgres: save attachment, file goes to uploads/
        end
        worker ->> postgres: read active ai_config
        worker ->> redis: read history of this session
        worker ->> postgres: read chat prompt and model
        worker ->> gemini: chat prompt + history + new messages, photos as images
        gemini -->> worker: texts + buttons JSON, streamed
        Note over worker: empty texts dropped, over 5 texts joined into the 5th<br/>button words cut to 20 letters
        worker ->> postgres: save ai_call with tokens, status ok or warning
        worker ->> line: reply with the latest reply_token<br/>up to 5 bubbles, buttons under the last one
        line ->> reporter: bot messages + buttons<br/>location, camera, camera roll, answer words
        worker ->> postgres: save bot messages, mark buffered messages answered
        worker ->> redis: add new messages and answers to history<br/>drop answered messages from buffer
        worker ->> redis: PROCESSING to IDLE
        opt messages came in while Gemini was answering
            worker ->> redis: IDLE to BUFFERING, push chat job
        end
    end

    %% reporter goes quiet: sequence-leaving.mmd
